====

Security requirement testing ensures that security requirements have been correctly implemented.

When a security requirement mitigates a cyber risk, testing that the requirement has been implemented as specified is not sufficient on its own. The testing must also attempt to defeat (thwart) the mitigation, whenever such testing is practical. That testing is covered by the 'Test risk mitigations' control.

== How to decide if this control is required

This control is required, if security requirements have been identified.

== How to implement

Create a review of security requirement testing and follow the instructions in the template.

